    "description": {
      "value": "_The Winged Serpent_ represents the wisdom of knowing when to act. As long as you have _The Winged Serpent_ invested, you gain a +2 item bonus on initiative checks made with sight-based Perception checks. This bonus increases to +3 if you are 17th level.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou swipe _The Winged Serpent_ across your eyes to gain insight on when to strike. You cast foresight on yourself, but the duration is only 10 minutes. If you're at least 17th level, the duration extends to 1 hour and you can cast foresight on another creature by touch. The level of this spell is one-half your level rounded down (minimum 9th)."
    },
